Bundled assets and datasets ship under their respective licenses:

- `skills/_assets/fonts/mirage-variable.woff2` — Mirage variable typeface,
  part of the Play New design system. License terms to be confirmed
  before public redistribution; if shipping a fork that cannot include
  Mirage, drop the woff2 file and the design system falls through to
  the system-ui / -apple-system fallback chain declared in
  `skills/design.py`.

- `skills/playbooks/ai-exposure/data/anthropic-aei-onet-*.csv` and
  `anthropic-task-penetration.csv` — Anthropic Economic Index dataset,
  copyright Anthropic, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
